---
/**
 * Services — Hero
 * Figma: "Frame 2147232974" (10103:138), 1728×792
 * https://www.figma.com/design/9SsfbCUY7KcxjZpCuRpDxf/Hello-Robo-Website-2026?node-id=10103-138
 */
---
<section class="services-hero container">
  <h1 class="services-hero__title t-h1">
    Building the robot was never the hard&nbsp;part.
    <img class="services-hero__stamp" src="/images/services/stamp-thinkers.svg" alt="" width="252" style="--w: 252" height="82" />
  </h1>
  <div class="services-hero__intro">
    <p class="t-body">Our services</p>
    <p class="services-hero__text t-body">
      The hard part was building for humans, so the world says yes to your robot.<br />
      We design for that moment.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-hero {
    padding-top: var(--space-40);
    padding-bottom: calc(39 * var(--px));
  }
  /* Figma's 1233 wide, the two lines balanced */
  .services-hero__title {
    width: calc(1233 * var(--px));
    max-width: 100%;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  /* the stamp follows the last word, 22 after it (as Figma has it after "yes"), and
     drops to the next line with it if the line runs out */
  .services-hero__stamp {
    display: inline-block;
    width: calc(252 * var(--px));
    height: auto;
    margin-left: calc(22 * var(--px));
    vertical-align: calc(0.1em);
  }
  .services-hero__intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: calc(830 / 1648 * 100%) calc(680 * var(--px));
    margin-top: calc(389 * var(--px));
  }

  /* ── Mobile (no Figma frame yet — follows the Home mobile rules) ── */
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .services-hero {
      padding-top: var(--space-20);
    }
    .services-hero__stamp {
      position: static;
      display: block;
      width: 180px;
      margin: var(--space-24) 0 0;
    }
    .services-hero__intro {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: var(--space-24);
      margin-top: 164px;
    }
  }
</style>
